⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢠⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⡿⠁
⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣴⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣇


a just in time compiler for the exo language.

// serves as a prototype for PyJIT:
// https://github.com/xdslproject/xdsl/tree/main/tests/filecheck/projects/pyjit

we take the Exo IR and map it to the LLVM dialect
in xDSL, which is hooked to the llvmlite MCJIT backend.


usage:

    $ uv run exojit example.py --mlir
    $ uv run exojit example.py --c
    $ uv run example.py


references:

- Exo language: https://github.com/xdslproject/xdsl/commits/main/?author=sueszli
- xDSL: https://github.com/exo-lang/exo/commits/main/?author=sueszli
- llvmlite: https://github.com/numba/llvmlite
